    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nImpressive 4 bedroom semi-detached residence ideally situated within easy walking distance of Bantry town and all its amenities. The home is exceptionally well maintained by its current owners and is substantially renovated and extended over the years to create a spacious and versatile family home occupying a particularly large elevated site.\n\nThe accommodation begins with a welcoming entrance porch and hallway leading to a large living room. This bright and inviting space is enhanced by the incorporation of a sunroom extension and creates a wonderful open-plan living area with direct access to an outdoor patio.\nThe kitchen is another standout feature, benefiting from dual aspect to both the front and rear, ensuring an abundance of natural light throughout the day. There is ample space for a full dining table and chairs while a central island provides additional preparation and storage space making it ideal for family living and entertaining. To the rear of the property a large utility room offers excellent practicality and provides access to the enclosed rear garden and patio area. \n\nThe first floor accommodation comprises 4 well-proportioned bedrooms including a master bedroom with en-suite together with a spacious family bathroom.\nExternally, the property enjoys a superb elevated position with attractive tiered lawn areas and generous outdoor space. There are numerous sheds and workshops providing excellent storage or hobby space, whilst the patio adjoining the living room offers a perfect setting for outdoor dining and relaxation. The property also benefits from off-street parking.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, extensive outdoor space and a highly convenient location, this is an outstanding family home.\n\nLocated within comfortable walking distance of Bantry town, the property enjoys the convenience of immediate access to a wealth of local amenities. Set on the shores of Bantry Bay along the Wild Atlantic Way, Bantry is a thriving maritime and market town, celebrated for its scenic beauty, bustling marina, excellent shopping, schools and restaurants as well as its rich cultural and recreational offerings. The surrounding West Cork countryside and coastline provide endless opportunities for outdoor pursuits, making this an exceptional location in which to live.\n\nDisclaimer:\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, all information is provided in good faith and is believed to be correct, but is not guaranteed. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all details by independent inspection or enquiry. No representation or warranty is made regarding the condition, measurements, boundaries, planning status, services or other information relating to the property. All measurements, maps, photographs and distances are approximate and for guidance purposes only. Photographs, video and drone imagery are provided for illustrative purposes and may include features, furnishings or items not included in the sale."
      },
